# Kiosk Relay Pilot

| | |
|---|---|
| **Date** | 2031-04-02, 10:00 to 10:02 |
| **Length** | 1 min |
| **Participants** | Avery Quinn (presenting), Rohan Dasgupta, Mira Okafor |
| **Source** | Meeting recording. Speaker-attributed transcript and board read by glassrip; every item cites transcript segments or board events and was checked by the validator. |

## Summary

- The pilot focuses on the relay side; the badge flow stays as it is (00:26 to 00:32)
- Rohan owns the relay storage schema and Mira connects ledger records to kit widgets (00:33 to 00:43)
- Which kiosk widgets to build is still open (00:15 to 01:03)

