- 10% of words (14 words, 6 s of speech) were attributed by gap filling, where the diarizer marked speech as silence; their speaker is less certain. Checked against the video: 1 of 1 runs had an on-screen speaker cue; 1 agreed, 0 disagreed (0 relabeled, 0 words).
